              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwe likhekholekhe lirio aaba bali omundu abonela omukhasi wewe bubi. Omusaayi akhemie omukhasi ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, mala akhole koosi khu niye khuloondekhana ne lilaka lino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
